 a Sand Soldier, up to a maximum of 2.","Sand Soldiers cannot attack structures, wards, nor traps.","See Pets for more details about Sand Soldiers."]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Shifting Sands","rows":[{"attribute":"Shield Strength","modifiers":[{"values":[70,110,150,190,230],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[60,60,60,60,60],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[60,100,140,180,220],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[40,40,40,40,40],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["If Azir dashes into an enemy champion, he stops and gains a charge of Arise!.","A summoned Sand Soldier is required to cast this ability. Azir can cast of any of his abilities during the dash."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Emperor's Divide","rows":[{"attribute":"Width","modifiers":[{"values":[6,7,8],"units":[" soldiers"," soldiers"," soldiers"]}]},{"attribute":"Width (charge)","modifiers":[{"values":[620,720,820],"units":["","",""]}]},{"attribute":"Width (impassable wall)","modifiers":[{"values":[750,850,950],"units":["","",""]}]},{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[200,400,600],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[75,75,75],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Upon finishing their charge, the soldiers stand as a wall for 5 seconds, acting as impassible terrain against enemies and granting sight of their surroundings. Azir and his allies can move through these soldiers."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"26.21","date":"2026-10-20","articleDate":"2026-10-20","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-21-notes/#patch-azir","changes":[{"slot":"S","title":"기본 능력치","text":"마나 증가량 : 레벨당 40 ⇒ 레벨당 50","kind":"buff"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"26.16","date":"2026-08-11","articleDate":"2026-08-11","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/gam